  "description": "The Flathead County Parcel Polygon data is comprised of taxable parcels (fee land) and public land (exempt property). It is broken down into individual lots.Each parcel contains an attribute called TRACT_ID that is the parcel identifier. It relates to the historical creation of the tract information assigned by the Flathead County Plat Room.Data is built upon the Flathead County Base Map (FCBM). The FCBM is a complex measurement management system that uses a least squares adjustment of existing survey data to come up with a digital representation of the Public Land Survey System (PLSS). Accuracy varies between townships and it is important to note that the accuracy of the parcel data can not be any more accurate than the FCBM.",
